  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "30A Sunset Features<br>- 100 Yards from the San Juan Beach Access<br>- Gulf Views!<br>- Private pool and sundeck. Pool can be heated for an additional fee for reservations October - April<br>- Outdoor Grill<br>- Access to 6 Taxi Bikes, serviced regularly to keep them in top shape<br>- 6 Min bike ride to Seaside with lots of shopping and dining options<br>- 1 Min bike ride to Prema Organic Cafe and Balance Health Studio with pop-in yoga classes.<br>- Access to a 6-seater LSV (Golf Cart). Some restrictions apply and must sign waiver to use cart during your stay<br>- Designer EVERYTHING! Incredible details throughout the home perfectly combining high-end luxury with coastal beach comfort<br>- Pet friendly for up to 2 dogs, 45 pounds or less, non-shedding. Must get approval from Exclusive 30A and pay a non-refundable pet fee to avoid fines<br>- Separate Carriage House with sleeping for 4 in two bedrooms, full bath, living room, and kitchenette. Carriage house private entrance accessed by stairs facing the pool area <br>- Private elevator in the main house, which travels to all floors. Adult use only. Please ask for details regarding mobility considerations for anyone in your group.<br>- 1st floor game room with game table and lounge area<br>- Laundry rooms on the 1st and 3rd floor of the main house<br>- Living rooms on the 1st, 2nd, and 4th floor<br>- Full Gourmet Kitchen and main dining on the 2nd Floor<br>- Kitchenette and dining area on the 4th floor<br>- 2nd Floor furnished balcony overlooking pool area<br>- 4th Floor furnished balcony with Gulf Views<br>- SmartTVs with streaming services (no cable)<br>- 4 backpack beach chairs, 2 umbrella setups and 2 beach wagons available<br>- Garage parking for 2 vehicles and driveway parking for 3 vehicles. RVs, Trailers, and street parking not permitted. <br>- Concierge services available including grocery delivery, private chef services, beach service, baby equipment rentals, boat charters, and more!<br>- At least one mid-stay clean is required for any reservation 10 days or longer and this cost is included in your reservation. Extra cleans can be scheduled for an additional fee<br><br>8 Bedrooms, 7 Full Baths and 1 Powder Room, Sleeps 20<br>- 1st Floor Bunk Room: sleeps up to 4 in two Twin XL/Twin XL Bunks, adjacent to full bath with combo shower/tub<br>- 2nd Floor King Suite 1: reach-in closet, TV, ensuite bath with walk-in shower<br>- 3rd Floor King Suite 2: TV, walk-in closet, ensuite bath with walk-in shower<br>- 3rd Floor King Suite 3: TV, walk-in closet, ensuite bath with walk-in shower<br>- 3rd Floor Queen Suite: sleeps up to 4 in two Queen Beds, TV, walk-in closet, ensuite bath with walk-in shower<br>- 4th Floor King Suite 4: TV, walk-in closet, ensuite bath with walk-in shower and soaking tub<br>- Carriage House Queen Guest Room: main floor of carriage house (must use stairs for entry to carriage house), adjacent to full bath with walk-in shower<br>- Carriage House King Loft: sitting room, walk-in closet, access to full bath on the main floor of carriage house<br><br>Welcome to your slice of paradise! Nestled just 100 yards from the pristine sands of the beach, this luxurious home offers the ultimate coastal retreat. As you step inside, you'll be greeted by an exquisite interior adorned with elegant furnishings and coastal-inspired decor.<br><br>Entertaining is a breeze in the gourmet kitchen, complete with top-of-the-line appliances, granite countertops, and a large island with seating. Whip up culinary delights while enjoying the company of friends and family in the adjacent dining area, or take the party outdoors to the covered patio with a built-in grill and al fresco dining area.<br><br>But the luxury doesn't end there - this home also features a private pool, where you can take a refreshing dip or soak up the sun on plush lounge chairs. For the adventurous at heart, hop on one of the provided bikes or take the LSV (golf cart) for a spin around the neighborhood, exploring all that Seagrove has to offer.<br><br>For guests seeking additional privacy, the carriage house apartment offers a serene retreat with its own living area, kitchenette, two bedrooms, and a full bath.<br><br>Need something larger? An identical home is available right next door! Perfect for wedding parties, reunions, or corporate retreats to enjoy the best 30A has to offer. Ask for more details!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Designer Home with Gulf Views, One Minute to the Beach, Heated Private Pool"
        }
      ],
